","D":"-6-"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q22.webp","originalPage":6,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/lines-and-lettering","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"lines-and-lettering"},{"id":"112-2-23","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":23,"answer":"C","excerpt":"文藝復興時期強調圓形空間作為上帝象徵的想法，是完整性和完美的象徵。西方學者對 幾種文藝復興時期的幾何結構進行分析，發現經常使用多中心橢圓的幾何結構。已知某 教堂內部橢圓空間之長軸、短軸以及兩個正圓弧圓心A、B，如圖(六)所示。此橢圓的繪 製方法稱為何？","options":{"A":"焦點法","B":"同心圓法","C":"四心法","D":"平行四邊形法 圖(六)"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q23.webp","originalPage":7,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/lines-and-lettering","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"lines-and-lettering"},{"id":"112-2-24","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":24,"answer":"A","excerpt":"工程圖係呈現設計者理念的表達工具，如何繪製正確的圖面須精準掌握製圖的基本技巧。 圖面是由各種線所構成，線交接的正確與否，也會影響圖示正確性的判讀。下列有關 線的畫法何者錯誤？","options":{"A":"（詳見原題附圖選項 A）","B":"（詳見原題附圖選項 B）","C":"（詳見原題附圖選項 C）","D":"（詳見原題附圖選項 D）"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112-2-24.png","sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/lines-and-lettering","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"lines-and-lettering"},{"id":"112-2-25","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":25,"answer":"A","excerpt":"有關門的平面圖、立面圖、剖面圖符號，下列組合何者正確？","options":{"A":"（詳見原題附圖選項 A）","B":"（詳見原題附圖選項 B）","C":"（詳見原題附圖選項 C）","D":"- 7-"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112-2-25.png","sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/sectional-views","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"sectional-views"},{"id":"112-2-26","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":26,"answer":"C","excerpt":"Albert繪製某建築結構平面圖如圖(七)，下列所標示的構材與符號何者錯誤？ 圖(七)","options":{"A":"Ⅰ為柱，符號為 C","B":"Ⅱ為構架樑，符號為 G、B；Ⅲ為非構架樑，符號為 b","C":"Ⅳ為板，符號為 F；Ⅴ為懸臂板，符號為 CF","D":"Ⅵ為構架懸臂樑，符號為 CG、CB"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q26.webp","originalPage":8,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/architectural-plan","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"architectural-plan"},{"id":"112-2-27","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":27,"answer":"CD","excerpt":"Maynard所繪製的等角圖與三視圖之組合中，下列何者錯誤？","options":{"A":"（詳見原題附圖選項 A）","B":"（詳見原題附圖選項 B）","C":"（詳見原題附圖選項 C）","D":"-8-"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112-2-27.png","sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/orthographic-projection","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"orthographic-projection"},{"id":"112-2-28","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":28,"answer":"D","excerpt":"依據CNS11567，有關圖(八)中符號 敘述何者正確？ D3 DN W1 1 D3 DW1 圖(八)","options":{"A":"附註說明項次 1，登錄於附註欄","B":"粉刷材料的說明符號","C":"圖號與圖面視點方向","D":"△為修改符號，內部數字為修改次數"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q28.webp","originalPage":9,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/dimensioning-and-symbols","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"dimensioning-and-symbols"},{"id":"112-2-29","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":29,"answer":"A","excerpt":"文藝復興時代的德國藝術家兼數學家杜勒( Albrecht Dürer ) ，是最早運用透視機( perspective machine )輔助繪畫的畫家。透視機是一個畫有格子的透明平面如圖(九)，而投影概念係將物體 的表面投影在透視機上，下列有關圖面投影原理的名詞LS、PL、SP、PP等的敘述何者正確？ 圖(九)","options":{"A":"視線、投射線、視點、投影面","B":"視軸線、投影線、視點、視平面","C":"視線、投影線、視點、投影面","D":"視軸線、投射線、視點、視平面"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q29.webp","originalPage":9,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/architectural-plan","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"architectural-plan"},{"id":"112-2-30","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":30,"answer":"C","excerpt":"正多面體又稱為柏拉圖立體，係以柏拉圖而命名。正多面體的作法被收錄在 《 幾何原 本 》 的第 13 卷。正多面體的各面均為大小相等的平面，且每一個頂點所接的面數都相 同，而符合這種特性的立體若列舉 5 種：正四面體、正六面體、正八面體、正十二面 體、正二十面體，其中何者構成多面體的面不是三角形？","options":{"A":"正四面體","B":"正八面體","C":"正十二面體","D":"正二十面體"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/architectural-plan","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"architectural-plan"},{"id":"112-2-31","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":31,"answer":"B","excerpt":"有關幾何製圖之敘述，下列何者錯誤？","options":{"A":"一組三角板，可以畫出 15 °夾角的線段","B":"一支 45°三角板與平行尺或直尺，可以畫出圓的外切正六邊形","C":"兩圓無論外切或內切，其切點必在兩圓心之連心線或連心線之延長線上","D":"若有一圓與一直線外切，其切點與此圓心之連線必會與該直線垂直"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/lines-and-lettering","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"lines-and-lettering"},{"id":"112-2-32","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":32,"answer":"B","excerpt":"某業主提供建築師事務所一正方形的基地地籍圖，比例 1 / 600，屬鄉村區丙種建築用地， 建蔽率40%、容積率120%，事務所設計師在計算時使用三稜比例尺誤將比例尺從1/400的 刻度來量測基地地籍圖，結果正方形單邊的讀數呈現為60m，則基地允建之最大建築面積 為何？","options":{"A":"1440 m 2","B":"3240 m 2","C":"5760 m 2","D":"9720 m 2 - 9- P L P P L S S P S P P L P S"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/scale","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"scale"},{"id":"112-2-33","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":33,"answer":"D","excerpt":"依據輔助視圖繪製之目的，已知 Elrond 所設計雕塑的立體圖如圖 ( 十 ) 所示，若欲求得圖 中斜面的實際形狀，下列何者為正確的輔助視圖？","options":{"A":"（詳見原題附圖選項 A）","B":"（詳見原題附圖選項 B）","C":"（詳見原題附圖選項 C）","D":"圖(十)"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q33.webp","originalPage":10,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/lines-and-lettering","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"lines-and-lettering"},{"id":"112-2-34","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":34,"answer":"D","excerpt":"Oropher設計一個立體雕塑，其等角圖如圖(十一)所示。依據附圖的條件，若將此等角圖 以正交 ( 與物體呈垂直或水平 ) 且不轉折的割面方式分別平直切割，則下列何者不屬於 該雕塑的剖面視圖？","options":{"A":"（詳見原題附圖選項 A）","B":"（詳見原題附圖選項 B）","C":"（詳見原題附圖選項 C）","D":"圖(十一)"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q34.webp","originalPage":10,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/sectional-views","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"sectional-views"},{"id":"112-2-35","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":35,"answer":"C","excerpt":"王家三兄弟繼承父親的矩形土地後分割為甲、乙、丙三筆如圖 ( 十二 ) 所示，其中王大擁 有乙地，王二與王三分別擁有矩形的甲、丙兩筆土地。王大為了開發乙地，委託建築師測 繪土地形狀並標註尺度(單位為 cm)，但因作業疏失而漏記其中一部分的尺寸(圖中標示問 號的範圍)。已知丙地面積為150m2，乙地在建蔽率50%的條件下可建建築面積為704m2， 則圖中被漏記的尺度為何？","options":{"A":"1800 cm","B":"2000 cm","C":"2200 cm","D":"2400 cm 圖(十二) -10-"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q35.webp","originalPage":10,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/dimensioning-and-symbols","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"dimensioning-and-symbols"},{"id":"112-2-36","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":36,"answer":"C","excerpt":"Andrew繪製某建築的平面圖(十三)，下列何者為正確的AA 剖面圖？ 圖(十三)","options":{"A":"（詳見原題附圖選項 A）","B":"（詳見原題附圖選項 B）","C":"（詳見原題附圖選項 C）","D":"（詳見原題附圖選項 D）"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q36.webp","originalPage":11,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/sectional-views","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"sectional-views"},{"id":"112-2-37","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":37,"answer":"D","excerpt":"Candy繪製某透天住宅立面圖，依據建築技術規則對於建築物相關高度的定義，下列組合 何者完全正確？ ①建築物高度為1036cm ②建築物高度為1486cm ③A處的簷高為1015cm ④A處的簷高為1035cm ⑤地板面高度為46cm ⑥一樓樓層高度為388cm","options":{"A":"②④⑥","B":"①④⑤","C":"②④⑤","D":"①③⑤  - 11-"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/architectural-elevation","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"architectural-elevation"},{"id":"112-2-38","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":38,"answer":"B","excerpt":"Landy 設計一幢無地下室的三層透天住宅，其圖中所有階梯的級高皆相同，一樓樓板高 程+60cm，其二樓平面圖如圖(十四)所示，則下列敘述何者錯誤？ 圖(十四)","options":{"A":"三樓樓板高程為 + 630 cm","B":"二樓的臥室 B 高程為 + 390 cm","C":"臥室 B 的上方有挑空","D":"圖中顯示該樓層有兩處陽臺  ▲閱讀下文，回答第 39-40 題 Andy 設計了一棟地上兩層樓住宅，一、二樓樓層高度皆為 3m，一樓樓地板與主入口平台 高程為+30cm，牆厚為 20cm，二樓陽臺牆厚為 10cm，繪製其各層平面圖如下圖所示。"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112/professional-2-q38.webp","originalPage":12,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/architectural-plan","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"architectural-plan"},{"id":"112-2-39","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":39,"answer":"A","excerpt":"下列何者有可能為此住宅的立面圖？","options":{"A":"（詳見原題附圖選項 A）","B":"（詳見原題附圖選項 B）","C":"（詳見原題附圖選項 C）","D":"（詳見原題附圖選項 D）"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/112-2-39.png","sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/architectural-elevation","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"architectural-elevation"},{"id":"112-2-40","year":112,"exam":"professional-2","subjectName":"專業科目（二）","questionNo":40,"answer":"D","excerpt":"本建築之二樓樓地板面積為何？( 根據建築技術規則，建築面積定義為：建築物外牆中心線 或其代替柱中心線以內之最大水平投影面積。……陽臺、屋簷及建築物出入口雨遮突出建築 物外牆中心線或其代替柱中心線超過 2.0m，或雨遮、花臺突出超過 1.0m 者，應自其外緣分 別扣除 2.0m 或 1.0m 作為中心線；每層陽臺面積之和，以不超過建築面積 1 / 8 為限，其未 達 8m2 者，得建築 8m2。樓地板面積定義為：建築物各層樓地板或其一部分，在該區劃中心 線以內之水平投影面積。但不包括不計入建築面積之部分。 )","options":{"A":"72.16 m 2","B":"73.04 m 2","C":"76.20 m 2","D":"77.20 m 2"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"112 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/drafting/orthographic-projection","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/112_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEyLTR5LTA2LTIucGRm","subject":"drafting","topic":"orthographic-projection"}]}
